This license covers the contents of scripts/ and host-tools/.

It does not cover the patch series:

  patches/nuttx/    applies to Apache NuttX and is Apache-2.0
  patches/existos/  applies to ExistOS-For-HP39GII and is GPL-3.0

The register headers under arch/arm/src/stmp3770/hw/ (inside patches/nuttx/)
contain fragments derived from NXP i.MX28 headers and from ExistOS; they keep
whatever terms their originals carry.

Upstream projects fetched at build time keep their own licenses:

  Apache NuttX          Apache-2.0
  Apache NuttX apps     Apache-2.0
  ExistOS-For-HP39GII   GPL-3.0
  sbtools (elftosb)     GPL-2.0-or-later, from Rockbox
